#%PAM-1.0
# PAM service for door's greeter session (the unprivileged UI process), used by
# door-greeter.service's PAMName. The greeter is a passwordless system user: it is
# permitted without authentication, but a session IS opened so pam_systemd
# registers a logind session for it — that registration is what grants the host
# compositor (doorstep) seat0 DRM/input access on its VT. Mirrors greetd's greeter
# PAM service. This service authenticates no human and must never be used for one.
auth      required  pam_permit.so
account   required  pam_permit.so
session   optional  pam_keyinit.so force revoke
session   required  pam_loginuid.so
session   optional  pam_systemd.so
session   required  pam_permit.so
